blurry-a 2026-11-26: fool_w.png, fool_b.png, general_w.png, general_b.png, glass_queen_w.png, glass_queen_b.png, king_w.png, king_b.png, knight_w.png, knight_b.png, mage_w.png, mage_b.png, marching_pawn_w.png, marching_pawn_b.png, prince_w.png, prince_b.png, rook_w.png, rook_b.png, viking_w.png, viking_b.png: replaced with the same icons from the game itself: The Ouroboros King (Oriol Cosp) official press-kit screenshot 1.png (3840x2160, Units list; press kit linked from https://oriolcosp.com/the-ouroboros-king/ -> https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HKkci7si8ZACRWb2wC-M74dim_rWgYTX). White icon keyed off the navy UI background, re-rendered at 512px (~90%, hard anti-aliased edges, no fading); black version = same icon with fill/line inverted, as the game draws black units. Glass Queen = the outline-only (glass) queen icon. Tool: /workspace/work/ba/okx2.py.
